Data licenses
=============

The lists in this branch are generated daily from third-party data. They are
not covered by the MIT license of the build code. Each list keeps the license
of the source it was built from. A preset that combines several sources is
distributed under the most restrictive license among them; CC BY-SA 4.0 is
one-way compatible with GPL-3.0, so a mix of the two is GPL-3.0. The full
text of GPL-3.0 is in COPYING.GPL-3.0 next to this file.

Sources
-------

1. v2fly/domain-list-community, MIT License
   https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community
   Used for: geosite/<name>.txt, except the lists in 2-6.

2. antifilter.download and community.antifilter.download, license not stated
   https://antifilter.download, https://community.antifilter.download
   Used for: geosite/antifilter-download, antifilter-download-community,
   and with 3: ru-blocked, ru-blocked-all.

3. Re:filter, MIT License
   https://github.com/1andrevich/Re-filter-lists
   Used for: geosite/refilter, and with 2: ru-blocked, ru-blocked-all.

4. runetfreedom/russia-domains-list, no license file
   https://github.com/runetfreedom/russia-domains-list
   Used for: geosite/ru-available-only-inside. Its author publishes it as part
   of runetfreedom/russia-blocked-geosite under GPL-3.0, so it is treated as
   GPL-3.0 here.

5. Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat, GPL-3.0
   https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat
   Used for: geosite/gfw.

6. WindowsSpyBlocker, MIT License
   https://github.com/crazy-max/WindowsSpyBlocker
   Used for: geosite/win-spy, win-update, win-extra.

7. runetfreedom/russia-blocked-geoip, GPL-3.0
   https://github.com/runetfreedom/russia-blocked-geoip
   Used for: geoip/ and geoip6/ ru-blocked, ru-blocked-community,
   ru-whitelist, re-filter, ddos-guard, yandex.
   Its data comes from the same projects as 2 and 3.

8. Loyalsoldier/geoip, CC BY-SA 4.0
   https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/geoip
   Used for: all other geoip/ and geoip6/ lists (countries and services).
